      {
        "code": "NO_FACTOR_ATTRIBUTION",
        "text": "'Draw' is a bucket holding everything that varies between two identical calls; no seed / hardware / order / version decomposition is claimed."
      },
      {
        "code": "NO_DRIFT_ABSENCE_CLAIM",
        "text": "A drift PASS means the checks that could run found nothing; UNAVAILABLE is not PASS, and absence of evidence of drift is not evidence of its absence."
